control: A body request is decided under the policy loaded after it arrived, so a newly listed domain is denied on the next call
removes: the composition root hands the body operation the active policy and loads nothing for the request
packages: ./mediate/app
tests: TestANewlyListedDomainIsDeniedOnTheNextCall
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

